  "description": "Guide Raven meets Esper Eve. It's clear they're meeting for the first time, but this man seems to know him far too well. He doesn't need to know every little thing about him: his habits, his unconscious behaviors, even his sexual preferences. Raven can't afford to distance himself, for fear of the potential repercussions if his precious body falls ill. Their awkward, uncomfortable partnership continues.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
